  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting': Hoth: Main Power Generators (1st Marker), Hoth: North Ridge (4th Marker), The Signal and A New Secret Base; these count toward the 60. There is no objective, so the 1st Marker (where A New Secret Base deploys) is the starting location; The Signal is the starting interrupt and A New Secret Base the Effect it deploys. Three more copies of The Signal are listed under Interrupts.",
